{"id":"en_the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts","title":"The Untamed Queen of Nine Beasts","titleEn":"The Untamed Queen of Nine Beasts","description":"In the Therian Empire, Emma—transported from Earth—awakens dual lightning and water abilities and ends up with nine alpha therian mates. Because of her lowly origins, she is looked down upon, so she takes the payouts from their breakups and devotes herself to hunting beasts in order to gain strength. The same haughty lords who cast her aside soon find themselves consumed by regret, hurrying to win back the fearless queen they had once left behind.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sci-Fi","Romance","Female","Plot Twist","Sweetness","Future"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d954e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d954e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d954e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d954e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-untamed-queen-of-nine-beasts_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d954e/?pub=